{"3909790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Flux Commander", "steam_appid": 3909790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flux Commander</strong> - <i>Bend Time. Raise Hell.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The year is 2073.</strong> Oligarchs and tech barons bought the world, and everyone’s freedom. Their private armies enforce control with machines and fear. But one pilot stands against them. You are a <strong>one-ship rebellion</strong> armed with <strong>Flux Energy</strong>, a mysterious power that bends time itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Flux Commander</strong>, you wield time as your weapon. Slow the chaos, dodge enemy fire, and strike back with precision. Inspired by classic arcade shooters, this is fast, tactical action where you control the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-Slowing Combat</strong>: Use Flux Energy to dodge, aim, and dominate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You Are the Bullet Hell: </strong>Overwhelm enemies with relentless firepower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylish Low Poly Look</strong>: Clean visuals, smooth gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable and Tactical</strong>: Master time control and evolve your strategy for the highest score.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They think they own everything. <strong>Be the rebellion they never saw coming.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flux Commander</strong> - <i>Bend Time. Raise Hell.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The year is 2073.</strong> Oligarchs and tech barons bought the world, and everyone’s freedom. Their private armies enforce control with machines and fear. But one pilot stands against them. You are a <strong>one-ship rebellion</st